@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@taskId = 1

### 1. Ambil semua task (pagination default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 2. Ambil task dengan filter status dan per_page
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=pending&per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### 3. Buat task baru (default status: pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Konfigurasi Routing MikroTik & Firewall",
  "description": "Uji coba rule NAT dan filter jaringan lab"
}

### 4. Buat task baru dengan status in_progress
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Testing Endpoint TaskService",
  "description": "Verifikasi respons JSON dan validasi field",
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 5. Perbarui task (ubah judul, deskripsi, atau status)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Konfigurasi Routing MikroTik & Firewall (Revisi)",
  "description": "Update catatan konfigurasi",
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 6. Tandai task sebagai selesai (mengisi completed_at)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Accept: application/json

### 7. Hapus task berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Uji error validasi status tidak valid (ekspektasi HTTP 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=invalid_status
Accept: application/json